{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v2",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "host-use"
  },
  "spec": {
    "annotations": [
      {
        "kind": "AnnotationQuery",
        "spec": {
          "query": {
            "kind": "DataQuery",
            "group": "grafana",
            "version": "v0",
            "datasource": {
              "name": "-- Grafana --"
            },
            "spec": {}
          },
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
          "builtIn": true,
          "legacyOptions": {
            "type": "dashboard"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "Método USE sobre node_exporter. Plan B de la Práctica 4 cuando From suggestions no carga.",
    "editable": true,
    "elements": {
      "panel-11": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 11,
          "title": "Errores de red",
          "description": "Paquetes con error por segundo en cada interfaz.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (device) (rate(node_network_receive_errs_total[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_errs_total[5m]))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{device}}",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "pps"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-12": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 12,
          "title": "El método USE",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "content": "## Método USE\n\nTres preguntas para cada recurso de la máquina.\n\n**Utilization**, qué fracción del tiempo está ocupado.\n\n**Saturation**, cuánto trabajo queda esperando.\n\n**Errors**, cuántas operaciones fallan.\n\nRED mira los servicios. USE mira la máquina donde corren.",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": ""
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "CPU en uso",
          "description": "Fracción del tiempo en que los núcleos no están ociosos.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
                        "legendFormat": "",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "gauge",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "percentunit",
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 1,
                  "thresholds": {
                    "mode": "absolute",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "value": null,
                        "color": "green"
                      },
                      {
                        "value": 0.7,
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      {
                        "value": 0.9,
                        "color": "red"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 3,
          "title": "Memoria en uso",
          "description": "Memoria que no está disponible para procesos nuevos.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes",
                        "legendFormat": "",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "gauge",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "percentunit",
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 1,
                  "thresholds": {
                    "mode": "absolute",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "value": null,
                        "color": "green"
                      },
                      {
                        "value": 0.7,
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      {
                        "value": 0.9,
                        "color": "red"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 4,
          "title": "Disco ocupado en I/O",
          "description": "Fracción del tiempo en que cada disco estuvo atendiendo lecturas o escrituras.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "rate(node_disk_io_time_seconds_total{device!~\"nbd.*|loop.*|ram.*\"}[5m])",
                        "legendFormat": "{{device}}",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "percentunit"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-5": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "Red",
          "description": "Bytes por segundo que entran y salen por cada interfaz.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (device) (rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{device!=\"lo\"}[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{device!=\"lo\"}[5m]))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{device}}",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "Bps"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-7": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 7,
          "title": "Carga por núcleo",
          "description": "Sobre 1 hay más trabajo esperando que núcleos para atenderlo.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "node_load1 / scalar(count(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}))",
                        "legendFormat": "carga de 1 minuto por núcleo",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-8": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 8,
          "title": "Tiempo esperando CPU, memoria e I/O",
          "description": "Presión del kernel (PSI). Fracción del tiempo en que algún proceso tuvo que esperar.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "rate(node_pressure_cpu_waiting_seconds_total[5m])",
                        "legendFormat": "cpu",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "rate(node_pressure_memory_waiting_seconds_total[5m])",
                        "legendFormat": "memoria",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "B",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "rate(node_pressure_io_waiting_seconds_total[5m])",
                        "legendFormat": "i/o",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "C",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "percentunit"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-9": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 9,
          "title": "Fallos de página mayores",
          "description": "Lecturas a disco porque una página de memoria no estaba en RAM. Si suben, falta memoria.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "prometheus"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "rate(node_vmstat_pgmajfault[5m])",
                        "legendFormat": "fallos por segundo",
                        "range": true
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {},
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "ops"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
